  "summary": "Summary\n\n•  Over 20 years of professional experience in Information Technology with extensive experience in the field of Enterprise Data Warehousing (EDW) and Data Integration.\n• Extensive design, development and testing experience with Oracle Warehouse Builder 10G and Talend Version 5.01/4 (commercial package)\n• Strong background in Oracle RDBMS v11/10g/9i/8i.\n• Expertise in working with SQL queries and PL/SQL (Stored Procedures, Triggers, Packages/Functions).\n• Excellent knowledge of the design and implementation of the Data Warehouse life cycle.\n• Familiarity with entity-relationship/multidimensional modeling (star schema, snowflake schema). \n• Knowledge of Data Warehouse/Data Mart design concepts.\n• Experience with business requirements gathering, business analysis and documentation.\n• Expertise in applying data integration concepts in Finance, Engineering, and Manufacturing business areas.\n• Experience in troubleshooting and handling production support duties on a 24x7 basis.\n• Strong analytical and problem solving skills.\n• Highly skilled, motivated team player with excellent communication and inter-personal skills.\n• Ability to work well under pressure and meet deadlines.\n\nTechnical Skills\n\nProgramming Languages: \t\tSQL, PL/SQL, Java\nDatabases: \t\t\t\tOracle 11g/10g/9i/8i, MS Access\nETL Tools: \t\t\t\tTalend, Oracle Warehouse Builder 10G\nScheduling tools: \t\t\tEspresso, Oracle Job Scheduler, Talend  \nOther Tools: \t\t\t\tSQL*Plus, TOAD, SQL Developer\nOperating Systems: \t\t\tWindows 7/XP, Solaris, Red Hat\nMethodologies: \t\t\tER/Multidimensional Modeling \n\t\t\t\t\t(Star/Snowflake), Data Warehouse Lifecycle\n\nAnalytical & Leadership Skills\n\t\nBusiness Analyst, Systems Analyst, Technical Writer, Technical Lead and Project Lead\nexperience.",
